{ Open with the Bird! }
1. f4 { Let's start with the main line for the Bird opening after which black and white plays strong moves (stockfish level 37 or higher). } 1... d5 { The Dutch Variation of the Bird opening is a strong response of black. It is called like this because it takes on the character of a Dutch Defence (1.d4 f5) with colours reversed. } 2. Nf3 g6 3. d3 Nf6 4. c3 Bg7 5. Nbd2 Ng4 *


